&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to own and shape the end-to-end customer lifecycle strategy, driving activation, engagement, retention, and reactivation across key customer segments. The role combines strategic ownership with hands-on campaign execution, using data, experimentation, personalisation, and multi-channel CRM to identify and unlock growth opportunities. Working closely with Product, Data, Marketing, Compliance, Risk, and Customer Service, you’ll optimise customer journeys, improve campaign ROI, remove lifecycle friction, and build scalable growth programmes and processes in a fast-moving, regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQ1gdeOLNoEsm2xDroWukiwGs3g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;TmEpdZKgYo39q5xn2CblIaW8gmw&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgjcWOpcWfGJuMcY7TXAtBnJ&quot;&gt;Lifecycle Growth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgB2xdHY3oZbyf9FCYastIKp&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the activation and retention strategy from registration and KYC through first deposit, first trade, repeat activity, dormancy, and reactivation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgue1OI764z7wVCcXo4LXySg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build segmented customer journeys across push, email, in-app messaging, SMS, incentives, and product experiences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgiwCMq0q5XnblreUsid87fh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop onboarding, habit-building, churn-prevention, and win-back programmes for retail, high-value, dormant, and VIP segments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgC8zWaxdNhRGme1Nce8tI34&quot;&gt;Campaign Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgt92IRJXo9aIJPX8Anr59Jc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the lifecycle campaign calendar and manage campaigns end to end: business case, brief, audience, budget, approvals, QA, launch, reporting, and post-campaign review.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgvouWnNAzqMilh0XfqOtczf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate CRM, product, content, creative, and promotional campaigns, ensuring clear timelines, ownership, and compliance with UAE requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgKVZ7llHEn7WRUOm3ODP6td&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage incentive economics and campaign ROI, balancing customer value, commercial impact, and operational complexity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgyq4co6YOehZ0oCLRi52Sjb&quot;&gt;Analytics and Operations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg7RUxw2XF5WK9OD6NhzW9Ad&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Use funnel, cohort, and behavioural analysis to identify drop-offs and prioritise the highest-impact opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgUMuH1IOuoqAdHqUmMNu2We&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Run hypothesis-led experiments across audience, message, timing, channel, offer, and product experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgoLKFr2zimGZRh84adt3X7c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with Product, Data, Marketing, Compliance, Risk, and Customer Service to remove lifecycle friction and translate insights into roadmap recommendations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgfvP8AoZ113f4EMUqEM3M1H&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
