descriptions.job-0loe2hk:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Deeply understand business requirements, author technical proposals and system designs, and lead the team to achieve business objectives;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Responsible for the planning, development, and optimization of shared technical components, driving their adoption into business applications; analyze system bottlenecks, resolve complex issues, and perform system performance tuning;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Explore emerging industry technologies and approaches to strengthen the company&#39;s technical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;5&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;6&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;7&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above in Computer Science or a related field;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;5+ years of backend development experience, with 2+ years of architecture experience in Golang;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Proficient in commonly used Golang frameworks, language features, and data structures, with deep understanding of their characteristics and underlying implementation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Skilled in API development with a solid understanding of concurrency principles; experience building high-concurrency, high-load systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Familiar with distributed systems; proficient in mainstream service frameworks and message middleware, with understanding of their implementation principles;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Strong logical thinking and business comprehension skills; good coding practices with clean structure and consistent naming conventions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Experience with Docker and Kubernetes automation or hands-on DevOps implementation is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0bdkqjc:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT HUT 8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine the ultimate destination for those who want to work at the cutting edge of technology, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;energy,&lt;/span&gt; and infrastructure. Hut&amp;nbsp;8 is on a mission to build and operate some of the world’s largest data centers for next-generation computing workloads, including AI, Colocation, Cloud, and Bitcoin Mining. We are proud to offer interesting and challenging opportunities for individuals who want to build teams, solve problems, and make an impact from day one. If you’re an ambitious individual looking for a career that is as rewarding as it is challenging, you’ve come to the right place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role provides the essential drafting, diligence, and legal oversight required for the execution of the company&#39;s energy and related infrastructure strategy. You will be responsible for the negotiation of power-related agreements for the Company&#39;s growing energy infrastructure platform, spanning grid-supplied power, on-site and behind-the-meter generation, and the acquisition of power-related assets. This role requires a sophisticated understanding of how energy regulatory frameworks and utility timelines dictate project viability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for structuring power supply arrangements and managing the legal risks associated with generation, interconnection, and transmission capacity, including drafting and negotiating energy service agreements, power purchase agreements, retail service agreements, fuel supply arrangements, and interconnection and other utility infrastructure agreements. You will be responsible for conducting due diligence related to power availability in connection with potential acquisitions of powered land and related infrastructure assets. Success in this role depends on your ability to align energy obligations with construction schedules, financing covenants, and customer commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energy Subject Matter Expert:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You possess deep knowledge of the North American power grid, including interconnection, transmission and distribution approval processes, and complex tariff structures. You have deep familiarity procuring power in both regulated utility markets and competitive retail energy markets, with working fluency in one or more major markets (e.g., ERCOT, PJM, MISO, SPP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Negotiator:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You have a proven track record of lead-negotiating multi-party infrastructure deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Risk Manager:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You can identify and mitigate regulatory and operational dependencies—such as curtailment risks and upgrade obligations—before they impact project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrated Advisor:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You excel at serving as an energy subject-matter expert for cross-functional teams in Strategic Transactions, Finance, and Development, and can translate complex regulatory and commercial issues into clear guidance for business decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive negotiations for interconnection agreements, shared facilities and other co-tenancy agreements, transmission service agreements, distribution arrangements, and other utility infrastructure agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and structure power supply agreements, energy service agreements, retail energy supply agreements, and ancillary service arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and procurement of on-site and behind-the-meter generation, including negotiation of fuel supply and gas transportation agreements, equipment supply and EPC arrangements for generation assets, and offtake structures for emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the Company&#39;s interests in utility large-load tariff proceedings, special contract negotiations, and related regulatory dockets impacting power procurement and cost allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide legal analysis of utility tariffs and rate structures, and manage regulatory compliance matters associated with owned or contracted generation assets, including FERC, NERC, and state public utility commission requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate energy trading and hedging documentation, including ISDA, NAESB, and EEI master agreements and related credit support arrangements, in coordination with finance and risk teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support participation in demand response, curtailment, and ancillary services programs, including structuring arrangements that monetize load flexibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the negotiation of power-related provisions in customer agreements, including power pass-through mechanics, ramp schedules, and power-related service levels, in coordination with leasing and commercial counsel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on renewable energy procurement, including renewable energy certificates (RECs), green tariffs, and structures supporting customer sustainability commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on key policies impacting generation procurement, interconnection, transmission and distribution, and power procurement regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the power-related portions of project financing deliverables, including diligence requirements and lender covenants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and negotiate letters of intent, asset purchase agreements, and membership interest purchase agreements related to the acquisition of power-related assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage legal risks and disputes related to operating assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct energy-specific outside law firms with a focus on budget control and internalizing institutional knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in training, mentoring, and scaling of legal and paralegal support resources as the energy platform grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active license to practice law in at least one U.S. state and a member in good standing of one U.S. bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise negotiating power purchase agreements, interconnection agreements, retail supply agreements, and utility infrastructure arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with FERC and state public utility commission regulatory frameworks; experience with NERC reliability standards and energy trading documentation (ISDA/NAESB/EEI) is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting project finance transactions, including lender diligence and covenant negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation, drafting, and communication (written and verbal) skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with a practical, business-oriented approach to legal issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Work Environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is in office at our corporate headquarters in the Brickell area of Miami, Florida. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT MAKES HUT 8 A GREAT PLACE TO WORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hut 8 offers a benefits and wellness program that includes medical, dental, vision, life, and&amp;nbsp;short-term and long-term disability insurance, as well as paid time off.&amp;nbsp;We are proud to invest in building the best team in the industry. At all levels of the organization,&amp;nbsp;we are driven by an entrepreneurial spirit, radical transparency, and relentless growth mentality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Hut 8, you will have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Work with bright, driven peers from a range of educational and professional backgrounds&amp;nbsp;including software development, energy, engineering, entrepreneurship, investment&amp;nbsp;banking, private equity, and management consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Design and pitch new products, services, and other initiatives to a leadership team&amp;nbsp;consisting of serial entrepreneurs and seasoned executives and backed by a board of&amp;nbsp;directors consisting of industry veterans of energy, finance, and government&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Debate ideas and alternatives in a truly meritocratic setting where the learning curve is&amp;nbsp;steep and the lessons come from both senior and junior members of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Build a lifelong network of friends and professional connections at the cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;intersection of technology, energy, and infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1njgwyg:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ripple Treasury (formerly GTreasury) is the leading innovator of integrated SaaS treasury and risk management solutions for the digital treasurer. Developed using the latest technology, Ripple Treasury helps empower organizations on their path to strategic treasury, by enabling total visibility into their cash, liquidity, payments and financial risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ripple Treasury, we believe that data-driven decisions are the heartbeat of a successful enterprise. As a Professional Services Consultant, you are the critical link between our cutting- edge technology and the real-world financial goals of our global clients. You aren&#39;t just implementing a platform; you are a digital architect and a trusted advisor. Your mission is to deeply understand a client&#39;s unique business environment, prescribe industry best practices, and architect a configuration that transforms their treasury operations into a powerhouse of efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Strategy: Lead deep-dive discovery sessions to uncover client pain points, workflows, and technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Architecture: Design and document the &quot;To-Be&quot; state, determining the optimal configuration of Ripple Treasury’s suite to meet specific client goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted Advisory: Act as a subject matter expert, guiding clients through treasury best practices and helping them modernize legacy processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation &amp;amp; Configuration: Take a hands-on approach to configuring the platform, ensuring the technical setup aligns perfectly with the strategic vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enablement &amp;amp; Training: Facilitate high-impact training sessions that empower users and ensure the client realizes the maximum ROI from our solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Partner with Sales, Product, and Engineering teams to provide client feedback and influence the future of our product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in client-facing solution consulting and/or software implementations, specifically in ERP or SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative Mindset: experience in roles where you don’t just take orders; you ask &quot;why,&quot; challenge the status quo, and lead clients toward better outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Aptitude: experience navigating complex software ecosystems and understanding how data flows between treasury systems, banks, and ERPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: experience translating &quot;tech-speak&quot; into &quot;CFO-speak,&quot; making complex financial concepts accessible and compelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treasury Domain Expertise: Deep knowledge of cash management, payments, risk, or hedge accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Fluency: Previous experience working with Corporate Treasury, Accounting, and/or Finance - comfortable discussing cash flow, debt, and financial risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please find our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;and our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

