&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AEW3d0Y2noLuIcxROuFubTLpsZd&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxustOiFVk8C3Uy4rotl5Nem5f&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q479dQIlZozY6cxcPNFuoY1rsxe&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKOAdw3kVoh5EQxcr2juP3i0sTb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;ZU0GdNgvPoqwDaxYk5Il6PHXg5b&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgFH9OtDi8u8PvJkp2X8pzld&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgcshnBWrgiqwwExm248CIVh&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgN8zLxussPqnhqjRPlJwBYd&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgMsYVVUxqrq8vMGWy3vW4cd&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgFFaNkDgui9Tgmu9wp2MSRb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgu9YbA2BuGAsFsAd2DLANOw&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1QW6d7OqWIidmdMRW3xhhe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JdbidBrjbo2RhixT7itlyPUOgGg&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Growth BI Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our CEO Office. This is a high-impact, end-to-end role that sits at the intersection of data intelligence and execution — covering OKX&#39;s key regulated markets globally. &lt;strong&gt;You will own the full loop:&lt;/strong&gt; identifying growth problems through data, diagnosing root causes, shaping recommendations, and driving outcomes through cross-functional execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IiNRdEmquoFBVcxiMPzlRQkpgCg&quot;&gt;Beyond technical and operational skills, what will set you apart is who you are. We are looking for someone with an exceptional ability to learn fast and operate in unfamiliar territory without losing direction. Someone who does not wait to be told what matters — you find it yourself. Someone who genuinely cares about the work and brings energy to problems that others find too messy or too ambiguous to touch.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgL1ggw4AAZMeTsBDSZTPjhg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgpWGz75t8MrfCDFxpQhezsd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Analytics &amp;amp; Insight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg9xlcKWGh1YJ4wDCZ2NW1dh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Monitor core growth metrics across regulated markets, proactively identifying anomalies, trends, and emerging opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgiIWhU5oIEANdpHuHuXlnmc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct structured root-cause analysis on growth performance — moving beyond data description to diagnosis: why did this happen, and what should we do about it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgGHRTU3bcrEoJw8YQoHSktb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate analytical findings into clear, prioritized recommendations for senior leadership and local market growth teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgPcfXT9syjFw0y5kV9o7wyc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and maintain analytical frameworks and dashboards that give leadership a clear, real-time view of market health and growth efficiency.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgqMtIxUiIanldm1eJ2AlqPf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgYmdNwQzMmdSwcm2KVNKAfe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the end-to-end execution of key growth initiatives: from scoping and planning through to delivery and outcome tracking.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg3C4gVg3McVVWCx84QF76ee&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive cross-functional coordination across growth, product, engineering, and operations teams — ensuring alignment, accountability, and on-time delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgo18dskkDgRcSJ34gtMwUFd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define measurable success criteria for each initiative and close the loop on results.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgbzdwZCIrqrV8craysw1HJS&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Augmented Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgKNph2zPApys0547h7zc3Ng&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Actively apply AI tools and automation to accelerate analysis, reporting cycles, and operational workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgLfsVzk7vGYgFjVifjUyLQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Champion AI-native practices within the team and demonstrate productivity gains through concrete examples.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkmeyjFfTrNPoYcWM2V4tpg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FNT7dlaWboPNAbx4SyglCPePgsc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 4 years of experience in growth analytics, business intelligence, strategy, or program management — ideally from a top internet company, fintech, Web3 firm, or management consulting background.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tp7IdGJbVo9ijAxI8MRlrYh0g4f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Exceptional learning agility — able to rapidly absorb new domains, connect the dots across unfamiliar data, and develop informed views in areas where you had no prior expertise.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAkQdspWnoc8mLxu6t7lc1Sbgzg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong logical and quantitative thinking — you break complex problems into structured components and form conclusions grounded in evidence, not assumption.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GZFtdV6ZQomZOtx9g5tlqxJagLh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Extreme self-motivation and ownership — you take full accountability for your workstreams, set your own direction, and are not satisfied until you see measurable outcomes. A genuine drive and passion for the work — you thrive in ambiguous, fast-moving environments, and find clarity and momentum where others find friction.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3YpdAPZboOCvCxPTpSlWKNpgGb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent communication skills; able to adapt between technical and non-technical audiences, and comfortable presenting to senior leadership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WrUgdB8azoWvnAxD6SPlT9W4g3e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bilingual proficiency in English and Mandarin Chinese is preferred to work with stakeholders in Mandarin-speaking markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1TFCIR5gT0jSKEqKk0k42c&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgH6kVTaY58BCJ4OfF0bgt1f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lj2LdnWNRoKUDKx2KRUlg4eYgrb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior experience in the Web3 or crypto industry, or as a user of crypto products — genuine familiarity with the space is a meaningful advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
