&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkPebHDrdNfDjUkNyNSyKtb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience building AI agent systems or complex workflows, beyond general tool usage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgpQbCNoMAwvE04GtLRkJchd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience working within international or multinational organizations, with cross-regional stakeholder exposure.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgByO2esoO8y7J09j8kk9Dad&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Solid track record in growth analytics or channel analysis — comfortable working with acquisition, retention, and channel performance data, and experience translating analytical work into growth decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg7O7DpgaCjSZHTfRntWmwif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
