descriptions.job-0y7o3tk:
&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn&#39;t work together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we&#39;ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We&#39;re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Square is seeking a Senior Partnerships Manager to develop and own a portfolio of Square&#39;s strategic partners in Australia. This role reports to the Partnerships Lead, APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will involve designing, negotiating, and scaling partnerships for Australia as the primary focus, but with a view to install best practices globally where opportunities present themselves. This is primarily a Business Development role, though deep expertise in partner management is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partners within the Australian portfolio include referral networks, distributors, service providers, technology platforms, and strategic ecosystems where there&#39;s mutual benefit to sellers through lead generation, co-sell, co-marketing, and product enablement. You&#39;ll use your deep payments knowledge and creativity to land win-win deals across all partner types.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role at the intersection of business development, growth, product, and go-to-market strategy. You will set the vision for your assigned partner portfolio. You will then work globally and cross-functionally, using your payments and relationships expertise to turn your vision into business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Negotiation&lt;/strong&gt;: Evaluate and secure high-impact partners and where required, identify and qualify them; lead executive-level negotiations and close deals that advance our capabilities and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Execution&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with Product, Operations, Marketing, Sales, and Legal to ensure smooth execution and maximum impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;: Deliver measurable results in lead generation, seller acquisition, and pipeline contribution through strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activation &amp;amp; Scaling&lt;/strong&gt;: Launch product partnerships with clear GTM plans, co-marketing initiatives, and integrated roadmaps where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and sustain C-level relationships with partners, ensuring long-term value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;: Define and track KPIs for partnership success, adjusting strategy as needed to drive continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in the payments space across roles such as business development, strategic partnerships, and/or product partnerships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of structuring, launching and scaling high-impact partnerships, and where required, sourcing such partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation and relationship management skills, with extensive experience working at the executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to connect partnership strategy directly to measurable seller acquisition and revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with global teams and functions, with a proven ability to thrive in this environment by collaborating globally in order to execute locally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS, fintech, or payments background strongly preferred. Whilst eCommerce experience will be valued highly, in-store experience is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is a proud equal opportunity employer. We work hard to evaluate all employees and job applicants consistently, without regard to identity or other legally protected class. We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about what we&#39;re doing to build a workplace that is fair and square? Check out our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/inside/about-inclusion-and-diversity&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; I+D page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block is a globally distributed company and this role will require working with other employees in multiple time zones. You may be required to perform work outside of normal business as part of this role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-07dfsrc:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;岗位概述&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;负责高价值客户的开发与维护，深入了解各家产品与解决方案，通过专业够听和定制化的解决方案，推动交易、资产及收入等关键指标的持续增长。该岗位高度&amp;nbsp;KPI&amp;nbsp;导向，需要强目标感、快速学习能力，同时能接受高强度出差。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;主要工作职责&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1-&amp;nbsp;开发与拓展&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;通过多渠道（线下拜访、行业会议、社群、转介绍等）挖掘并开发潜在高价值客户（包括但不限于专业交易者、家族办公室等）。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;能够快速画像并识别高潜力目标客户，建立并维护客户线索池和跟进节奏。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-&amp;nbsp;客户关系管理与业绩达成&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;建立并维护稳固的客户关系，定期Review，了解用户交易需求、资金规模与产品需求。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;对所负责客户的&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;资产规模、交易量、收益贡献等关键指标（KPI）负责&lt;/strong&gt;，按月度/季度完成业绩目标。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-&amp;nbsp;产品与解决方案咨询&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;深入理解各家主流交易平台的各产品条线（如：现货、合约、期权、Earn/理财、结构化产品等），能够为客户提供对比分析和专业建议。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;收集客户需求与痛点，协同产品、运营等团队，为重点客户提供定制化解决方案。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4-&amp;nbsp;行业洞察与学习&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;持续跟进行业动态、竞品策略和新产品形态，快速掌握并消化新知识，形成对客户有价值的观点与建议。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;定期输出客户/市场反馈与竞品情报，为内部策略和产品迭代提供一线视角。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;任职要求&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;至少&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;2&amp;nbsp;年及以上&amp;nbsp;web3&amp;nbsp;行业工作经验&lt;/strong&gt;，对主流交易所、钱包、托管、DeFi&amp;nbsp;等产品有实际使用或服务经验。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;能够&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;快速识别与筛选目标客户&lt;/strong&gt;，具备优秀的沟通谈判技巧与关系维护能力，有高潜力客户的客户关系管对金融市场、衍生品、风险收益等有基本认知，有银行、券商、资管等金融背景者优先。理、客户服务和运营等相关工作经验优先；&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;明确的&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;KPI&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;结果导向&lt;/strong&gt;，习惯用数据衡量业绩。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;能接受&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;高强度工作节奏与频繁出差&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;拜访&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;自驱力强，抗压能力好，能够在不确定环境中找到路径并推动落地。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;能够&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;中英文双语工作（听说读写）；&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;本科及以上学历，&lt;strong&gt;金融、经济、会计、数学、统计、计算机等相关专业优先&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;acquiring&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;managing&amp;nbsp;high-value&amp;nbsp;clients,&amp;nbsp;developing&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;deep&amp;nbsp;understanding&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;different&amp;nbsp;products&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;solutions&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;platforms,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;driving&amp;nbsp;sustainable&amp;nbsp;growth&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;trading&amp;nbsp;volume,&amp;nbsp;assets&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;revenue&amp;nbsp;through&amp;nbsp;professional&amp;nbsp;consultation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;customized&amp;nbsp;solutions.&amp;nbsp;This&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;highly&amp;nbsp;KPI-driven&amp;nbsp;role&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;requires&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;goal&amp;nbsp;orientation,&amp;nbsp;fast&amp;nbsp;learning&amp;nbsp;ability,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;ability&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;handle&amp;nbsp;frequent&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key&amp;nbsp;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1-&amp;nbsp;Client&amp;nbsp;Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;acquire&amp;nbsp;potential&amp;nbsp;high-value&amp;nbsp;clients&amp;nbsp;(including&amp;nbsp;but&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;limited&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;professional&amp;nbsp;traders,&amp;nbsp;family&amp;nbsp;offices,&amp;nbsp;etc.)&amp;nbsp;through&amp;nbsp;multiple&amp;nbsp;channels&amp;nbsp;such&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;in-person&amp;nbsp;visits,&amp;nbsp;industry&amp;nbsp;events,&amp;nbsp;communities&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;referrals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly&amp;nbsp;profile&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;high-potential&amp;nbsp;target&amp;nbsp;clients,&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;structured&amp;nbsp;lead&amp;nbsp;pipeline&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;follow-up&amp;nbsp;rhythm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-&amp;nbsp;Client&amp;nbsp;Relationship&amp;nbsp;Management&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Target&amp;nbsp;Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;strong,&amp;nbsp;long-term&amp;nbsp;relationships&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;clients;&amp;nbsp;conduct&amp;nbsp;regular&amp;nbsp;reviews&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;understand&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;trading&amp;nbsp;needs,&amp;nbsp;capital&amp;nbsp;scale&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take&amp;nbsp;full&amp;nbsp;responsibility&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;KPIs&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;portfolio,&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;asset&amp;nbsp;under&amp;nbsp;management,&amp;nbsp;trading&amp;nbsp;volume&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;revenue&amp;nbsp;contribution,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;achieve&amp;nbsp;monthly/quarterly&amp;nbsp;performance&amp;nbsp;targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-&amp;nbsp;Product&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Solutions&amp;nbsp;Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;in-depth&amp;nbsp;understanding&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;major&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;lines&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;trading&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;(e.g.&amp;nbsp;spot,&amp;nbsp;perpetuals,&amp;nbsp;options,&amp;nbsp;Earn/wealth&amp;nbsp;management,&amp;nbsp;structured&amp;nbsp;products,&amp;nbsp;etc.)&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;provide&amp;nbsp;professional&amp;nbsp;comparison&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;recommendations&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;needs&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;pain&amp;nbsp;points,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;product,&amp;nbsp;operations&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;deliver&amp;nbsp;customized&amp;nbsp;solutions&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4-&amp;nbsp;Industry&amp;nbsp;Insight&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Continuous&amp;nbsp;Learning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously&amp;nbsp;track&amp;nbsp;industry&amp;nbsp;trends,&amp;nbsp;competitor&amp;nbsp;strategies&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;types;&amp;nbsp;quickly&amp;nbsp;absorb&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;knowledge&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;translate&amp;nbsp;it&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;valuable&amp;nbsp;insights&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;suggestions&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly&amp;nbsp;share&amp;nbsp;client/market&amp;nbsp;feedback&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;competitive&amp;nbsp;intelligence&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;provide&amp;nbsp;frontline&amp;nbsp;input&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;strategy&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At&amp;nbsp;least&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;2&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Web3&amp;nbsp;industry&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;hands-on&amp;nbsp;usage&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;service&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;related&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;major&amp;nbsp;exchanges,&amp;nbsp;wallets,&amp;nbsp;custody&amp;nbsp;solutions,&amp;nbsp;DeFi&amp;nbsp;products,&amp;nbsp;etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;quickly&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;qualify&amp;nbsp;target&amp;nbsp;clients&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;communication,&amp;nbsp;negotiation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;relationship-building&amp;nbsp;skills.&amp;nbsp;Experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;managing&amp;nbsp;high-potential&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;relationships,&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;service&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;account&amp;nbsp;operations&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;preferred.&amp;nbsp;Basic&amp;nbsp;understanding&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;financial&amp;nbsp;markets,&amp;nbsp;derivatives&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;risk–return;&amp;nbsp;background&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;banking,&amp;nbsp;securities&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;asset&amp;nbsp;management&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;KPI&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;result&amp;nbsp;orientation&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;comfortable&amp;nbsp;using&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;measure&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;manage&amp;nbsp;performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;high-intensity&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;pace&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;frequent&amp;nbsp;travel&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;visits&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;self-motivation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;resilience,&amp;nbsp;able&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;find&amp;nbsp;paths&amp;nbsp;forward&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;drive&amp;nbsp;execution&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;uncertain&amp;nbsp;environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;both&amp;nbsp;Chinese&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;English&amp;nbsp;(listening,&amp;nbsp;speaking,&amp;nbsp;reading&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;writing)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s&amp;nbsp;degree&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;above;&amp;nbsp;majors&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Finance,&amp;nbsp;Economics,&amp;nbsp;Accounting,&amp;nbsp;Mathematics,&amp;nbsp;Statistics,&amp;nbsp;Computer&amp;nbsp;Science&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;related&amp;nbsp;fields&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Notice:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;26&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;All official &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; vacancies are published on this website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;While roles may appear on selected third-party platforms from time to time, information on other sites may be inaccurate or outdated. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;29&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;If in doubt, please apply directly through our official careers website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Information collected and processed as part of the recruitment process of any job application you choose to submit is subject to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;&#39;s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link rich-text-anchor __anchor-intercept-flag__ text-content-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.okx.com/en-eu/help/okx-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-eleid=&quot;19&quot; data-lark-is-custom=&quot;true&quot; data-lark-link=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

