&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AEW3d0Y2noLuIcxROuFubTLpsZd&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxuslsyQOGHoiYb47TiA1n51Th&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxustOiFVk8C3Uy4rotl5Nem5f&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q479dQIlZozY6cxcPNFuoY1rsxe&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKOAdw3kVoh5EQxcr2juP3i0sTb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusq2WnfR822THsuqUosdSzFu&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus9qcafz8J9vhi3nwZgrckWg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;We are seeking an exceptional, entrepreneurial Head of Communications for APAC. This person is a senior leader who will own and drive our regional communications strategy and execution while playing a pivotal role in global and regional PR initiatives. This is a high-impact role for someone who combines deep regional media relationships with an interest in and passion for the digital asset space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a builder: someone who&#39;s comfortable operating with autonomy, thrives in fast-moving environments, and knows how to convert communications strategy into measurable results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Candidates based in Hong Kong, Singapore, and Australia are encouraged to apply. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;We operate with regional flexibility and a results-first culture. We care about impact, not where you sit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;richTextDocs-unOrderList richTextDocs-unOrderList-disc&quot; data-eleid=&quot;14&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Lead the development and execution of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;&#39;s APAC communications strategy — setting direction, driving alignment, and delivering results across the region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;17&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Serve as the senior communications voice for APAC, partnering closely with marketing, product, legal, compliance, and local market leads.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;19&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Build and lead a high-performing communications function, including managing PR agency relationships across the region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;22&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Leverage your deep network of media contacts across Australia, Singapore, and broader APAC — including tier-one business, broadcast, financial, and crypto media — to drive high-impact coverage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;23&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Cultivate and own relationships with editors, journalists, and influential industry voices across key APAC markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;25&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;26&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Place compelling stories in top-tier general media and leading crypto publications, driving consistent coverage volume and quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Act as an integral member of the global comms/PR team, contributing to worldwide initiatives and helping amplify global campaigns across APAC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;29&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Activate PR opportunities through OKX&#39;s global partnerships, including McLaren F1 Team and Manchester City Football Club, generating visibility across media and potential users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;31&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Write and oversee PR plans, press materials, executive messaging, and content for key announcements and initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;33&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;34&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Ensure brand consistency and messaging discipline across all regional communications efforts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;35&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;36&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Track, report on, and actively influence media coverage to align with business objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusWnZPeJsdMU53QGew90VQeh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;richTextDocs-unOrderList richTextDocs-unOrderList-disc&quot; data-eleid=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;41&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;42&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;12–15 years of experience in PR and communications, with a strong background in financial services, fintech, or technology, crypto experience is preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;43&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;44&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Superior stakeholder management and presentation skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;45&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;46&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Established media connections across APAC relationships across business, broadcast, financial, and crypto media.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;47&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;48&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Proven track record running regional and global PR campaigns that generate significant, high-quality media coverage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;49&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;50&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Experience with investment and financial communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;51&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;52&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset, you set ambitious targets, hold yourself accountable, and know how to get results in ambiguous, fast-moving environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;53&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;54&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Team management experience and the ability to lead, mentor, and inspire.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
