descriptions.job-1ufaj88:
&lt;p&gt;Technical Product Marketing Manager - Brave Search APIs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote (USA and Europe)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Search&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About Brave&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brave is building the independent search infrastructure for the AI era.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brave Search API powers leading AI companies, applications, and developer frameworks. We’re looking for a Technical Product Marketing Manager who can understand our technology, translate it into clear market value, and help accelerate adoption across the LLM, agent, and RAG ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While others rely on Bing or Google APIs, Brave owns and operates its own global web index. This allows us to offer Zero-Data-Retention guarantees, independent ranking, and greater control over search infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a Technical Product Marketing Manager to lead positioning, go-to-market strategy, content, and growth initiatives for Brave Search API.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with Product, Sales, Engineering, Growth, and Developer Relations to understand our APIs, customer use cases, and developer workflows, then turn that knowledge into compelling messaging, campaigns, and sales materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has experience marketing AI, SaaS, developer tools, or APIs to both technical and business audiences. You are strategic, hands-on, data-driven, and comfortable working in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positioning and Messaging:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop differentiated messaging for developers, technical decision-makers, and enterprise buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Product Marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a working understanding of Brave Search API endpoints, integrations, developer workflows, and use cases, and communicate them clearly to technical and business audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product, Engineering, Sales, and Developer Relations on launches for new features, endpoints, integrations, and use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Media and Audience Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Support a focused social presence that amplifies product launches, technical content, customer stories, and industry insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Website and Conversion Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve the customer journey from initial visit through signup, API-key creation, evaluation, and subscription.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content and Sales Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Create website copy, blog posts, case studies, technical explainers, presentations, email campaigns, and battlecards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Insight and Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Track performance, customer feedback, competitive positioning, and market trends to improve messaging and conversion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work across Product, Sales, Engineering, Growth, and Developer Relations to align messaging and support pipeline growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Requirements and Qualifications&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product marketing experience, preferably in AI, SaaS, developer tools, or APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand technical products and explain them clearly to developers and business buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating content for APIs, developer platforms, or other technical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong copywriting, communication, positioning, and audience-development skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable reading API documentation and using tools such as developer consoles, API clients, GitHub, or basic code examples.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with analytics, SEO, AEO, HubSpot, Google Analytics, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on and comfortable working in a fast-paced, remote environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing to AI developers or enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with REST APIs, JSON, LLM applications, RAG, AI agents, or search technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developer frameworks, SDKs, open-source communities, or technical integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in growth marketing, developer engagement, or event planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise evaluations or high-value B2B sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to shape marketing for a leading AI and search API product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote flexibility with a collaborative, results-oriented culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, benefits, and professional development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US salary range of $150,000 to $175,000, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0ohdc48:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Backend&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team + role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood’s engineering organization spans Crypto, Brokerage, and Core Engineering, each responsible for systems that are foundational to how customers invest and manage their money! These teams build and operate platforms for trading, custody, ledgers, reporting, payments, and shared infrastructure, with a strong focus on correctness, reliability, and customer trust. Engineers partner closely with product, design, data, and infrastructure teams to deliver software that performs at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will design and build large-scale distributed systems that support real-time trading, balances, and platform capabilities. You will lead technically complex projects, contribute to architectural decisions, and collaborate with frontend and data partners to deliver well-structured APIs. Your work will directly influence system performance, operational safety, and long-term maintainability across core Robinhood products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our &lt;strong&gt;Menlo Park, CA&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;New York, NY&lt;/strong&gt; offices, with in-person attendance expected at least &lt;strong&gt;3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and evolve scalable backend systems, balancing performance, reliability, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, implement, test, and release product-facing features with strict correctness and availability requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with frontend and data engineers to define and refine REST APIs that serve millions of customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead large, technically complex projects from design through execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentor junior engineers through code reviews, design discussions, and hands-on technical guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify opportunities to improve system performance, developer productivity, and operational risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of professional software development experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of experience building low-latency, large-scale distributed systems in production environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing and operating highly concurrent systems and well-structured REST APIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ownership of large projects with sustained impact on a system or team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong technical judgment and the ability to prioritize work aligned with business and reliability goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to break down complex problems and deliver practical, high-quality solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience mentoring other engineers and contributing to technical direction on new initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Best in class benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lifestyle wallet — a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$230,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$172,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$202,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$153,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$179,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-10z2c7s:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to hire an experienced Grains and Oilseeds Analyst to collaborate closely with our Trading team to build comprehensive supply/demand models for major agricultural markets, develop granular balance sheet analytics, and generate actionable trading insights in corn, soybeans, wheat, and other key agricultural commodities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 3+ years of analyst experience in agricultural commodities, grains, or related commodity markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative modeler with experience in supply/demand fundamentals analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a deep understanding of agricultural market seasonality, production cycles, and trade flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical thinker with proficiency in statistical modeling and scenario analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, collaborative trading environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator with the ability to translate complex analysis into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding skills are preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0lfzllk:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;We are looking for Quantitative Researchers to help us build models, strategies and systems that price and trade financial instruments. You&#39;ll apply your experience in experiment design, dataset generation, time series analysis, feature engineering and model building to financial datasets, while collaborating with colleagues who will challenge and refine your approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Jane Street, our researchers, engineers and traders sit a few feet away from each other and work together to train models, architect systems and run trading strategies. We work with petabytes of data and a growing GPU cluster containing tens of thousands of high-end GPUs. Depending on the day, we might be diving deep into market data, tuning hyperparameters, debugging distributed training performance or studying how our model likes to trade in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;We don’t believe in “one-size-fits-all” modelling solutions; we are open to and excited about applying all different types of statistical and machine learning techniques, from linear models to deep learning, depending on what best fits a given problem. The most successful researchers will be driven by a curiosity for how their contributions fit into the larger picture of our trading operations, and how to adapt their findings into actionable strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’ve never thought about a career in finance, you’re in good company. Many of us were in the same position before working here. If you have a curious mind and a passion for solving interesting problems, we have a feeling you’ll fit right in. You should be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to apply logical and mathematical thinking to all kinds of problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious; eager to ask questions, admit mistakes and learn new things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong programmer who’s comfortable with Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An open-minded thinker and precise communicator who enjoys collaborating with colleagues from a wide range of backgrounds and areas of expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
